# lens_tests.kujo — Lens test suite.
#
# Validates CLI parsing, URL validation, report generation, exit codes,
# and config behavior. Uses a hand-rolled harness (like changebucket)
# because the built-in test framework cannot see file-level imports.
#
# Run with:
#   kujo test
#   kujo run tests/lens_tests.kujo

